// ==========================================================================
// K8: get AlltoAll
//
// Each rank RDMA-READs peer's sendBuff[myRank*size..] into local
// recvBuff[peer*size..]. Producer fills sendBuff, consumer pulls via get().
// Synchronized by barrier. No fused signal — get() has no signal action; the
// post-barrier ensures completion visibility.
// ==========================================================================

